--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Not in this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

No foundry data of any kind: no standard-cell libraries
(.lib/.db/.lef/.gds), no memory-macro models or views, no gate-level
netlists, no .sdf/.spef. The gate-level flow requires your own PDK and
your own synthesis licence. See README.md and syn/README.md.
